# NFL path lock (file-glob layer)

If you are editing a file matching these globs, stop unless the owner already
said **UNLOCK NFL** in this conversation with a named miss.

This is an extra lock layer on top of `locked-nfl.mdc` / AGENTS Rule 12.
Shared files (`NHL77FINAL.py`, `team_results_charts.py`) are not matched here —
those still require UNLOCK NFL before any NFL-only branch change.
